WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.719 --> 00:00:03.512
KANG THE CONQUEROR
You're an interesting man, Scott Lang.

00:00:04.445 --> 00:00:05.597
You have a daughter.

00:00:06.577 --> 00:00:07.524
CASSIE LANG
Dad!

00:00:07.758 --> 00:00:08.892
KANG THE CONQUEROR
You're an Avenger.

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:10.567
[Yelling]

00:00:11.563 --> 00:00:12.748
KANG THE CONQUEROR
Have I killed you before?

00:00:16.039 --> 00:00:17.735
JANET VAN DYNE
He can shatter existence.

00:00:19.086 --> 00:00:21.255
KANG THE CONQUEROR
You may not want her to watch this.

00:00:22.331 --> 00:00:23.365
SCOTT LANG
Kang!

00:00:24.455 --> 00:00:25.197
[Screaming]

